**POST /api/v1/memos**

Defined by the `google.api.http` annotation on the `CreateMemo` RPC in `proto/api/v1/memo_service.proto:21-27`:

```proto
rpc CreateMemo(CreateMemoRequest) returns (Memo) {
  option (google.api.http) = {
    post: "/api/v1/memos"
    body: "memo"
  };
  option (google.api.method_signature) = "memo";
}
```

The request body is the `memo` field (a `Memo` message). The generated gateway binding mirroring this lives in the generated code under `proto/gen/api/v1/` (e.g. `memo_service.pb.gw.go` / the Connect procedure `MemoServiceCreateMemoProcedure` in `proto/gen/api/v1/apiv1connect/memo_service.connect.go`, which is the separate Connect-RPC path `/memos.api.v1.MemoService/CreateMemo`).
